sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant App as RAG Backend<br/>retrieval_chain.invoke()
    participant DB as Chroma Vector DB
    participant EMB as OllamaEmbeddings
    participant LLM as ChatOllama

    U->>App: Ask a question (input)
    App->>DB: Retrieve top-k similar chunks
    DB->>EMB: Use embeddings to compute similarity search
    EMB-->>DB: Embedding vectors + scores returned
    DB-->>App: Top-k most relevant document chunks (context)
    
    App->>LLM: Send prompt with strict instructions + context + question
    LLM-->>App: Context-grounded answer <br/>OR fallback message if insufficient context
    App-->>U: Final Response
